        "title": "What the cell membrane does",
        "level": "standard",
        "explanation": "The membrane is a selective barrier: it decides what gets in and out.",
        "analogy": "Like a bouncer at a club checking who may enter.",
        "keyPoints": [
          "Selective barrier",
          "Controls transport"
        ],
        "commonMisunderstandings": [
