        "question": "What is the main role of the cell membrane?",
        "type": "single-choice",
        "options": [
          "Energy production",
          "Selective barrier",
          "Storing DNA"
        ],
        "answer": "Selective barrier",
        "explanation": "It regulates what enters and leaves the cell.",
